#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:3
#: 611804e0996247418611567021c13bf0
msgid ""
"ROS 2 parameters for public controllers in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). "
"Code pin: [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48). "
"**Startup / Runtime** wording matches the READMEs in [pull request "
"#120](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/pull/120) "
"(`e1b7a147`). How to load and inspect: [Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md). Topics "
"and FSM integers: the per-controller pages (not repeated here)."
msgstr ""
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) "
"公开控制器的 ROS 2 参数。代码钉在 [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48)。**仅启动"
" / 运行时** 措辞与 [pull request #120](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/pull/120)（`e1b7a147`）的 README 一致。如何加载与查看：[配置 ROS 2 "
"控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)。话题与 FSM "
"整数见各控制器页面（此处不重复）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: d3217bb237244201959bb8ce2d72dbe6
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:8
#: 3b0d28142a4e43959fc0229b14b714a7
msgid ""
"Names, types, and defaults come from the linked README (or `auto_declare`"
" / `declare_parameter` at the code pin when the README says so). **When**"
" tags are **Runtime** / **Startup only** / **Unverified** as in #120. "
"Framework commons (`joints`, `update_rate`, `command_interfaces`, "
"`state_interfaces`, optional `command_prefix`) are on the [how-"
"to](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#framework-common-"
"parameters) only."
msgstr ""
"名称、类型和默认值来自链接的 README（README 有说明时，则以该代码钉上的 `auto_declare` / "
"`declare_parameter` 为准）。**何时生效** 标记与 #120 相同：**运行时** / **仅启动** / "
"**未核实**。框架共性键（`joints`、`update_rate`、`command_interfaces`、`state_interfaces`，以及可选的"
" "
"`command_prefix`）只写在[操作指南](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md"
"#framework-common-parameters)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:11
#: 8eded84cc8b74cbf817ddf50072c1d67
msgid "How to read the tables"
msgstr "如何读这些表"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:13
#: f2b31bc7dfcf41cc8b4d460fae1a48e9
msgid ""
"Three columns: **Parameter**, **Type / default**, **Meaning** (the "
"**When** tag is the last sentence of Meaning)."
msgstr "三列：**参数**、**类型 / 默认值**、**含义**（**何时生效**写在含义的最后一句）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: c2ff3db9391e4f5c80fedff510e049d5
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标记"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: dbc3248f6fb643fea0995b6fc6502741
msgid "Evidence (#120)"
msgstr "依据（#120）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 2511237ccd1344ceaf832aecbe958d4a
msgid "**Runtime**"
msgstr "**运行时**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: e58c5143d77f4a869cd973fbfeab35d7
msgid ""
"`get_parameter` on the next HOME enter, MOVEJ enter / joint command, "
"waist position plan, interpolating MoveL, MOVEJ `cartesian_defaults`, or "
"HOLD enter / each HOLD `run` (`StateHold::updateParam`)"
msgstr ""
"下次进入 HOME、进入 MOVEJ / 关节命令、腰部位置规划、插值 MoveL、MOVEJ `cartesian_defaults`，或进入 "
"HOLD / 每个 HOLD `run`（`StateHold::updateParam`）时 `get_parameter`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 1886aeddf6984b3db0dedaeff8292b65
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: d79607d68ed74e29b0e542307b10c0f2
msgid ""
"Member set in `on_init` / constructor / first waist-planner create; or "
"README “reload / restart”"
msgstr "在 `on_init` / 构造函数 / 首次创建腰部规划器时写入成员；或 README 所说的「重新加载 / 重启」"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: b7002806e2f54a5f86fb3cd98a5d9718
msgid "**Unverified**"
msgstr "**未核实**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 84eccd5477e24437b7efe1c9bc86b760
msgid "No documented key in these tables is Unverified in #120"
msgstr "#120 中这些表里已文档化的键都不是未核实"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:21
#: 9ce2c00284944226a6924310b5c847ef
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`config/ocs2/*.info` is **not** the ROS 2 parameter server. `robot_name` "
"selects `{robot_name}_description`; the task file is "
"`{pkg}/config/ocs2/task.info` unless launch YAML sets `info_file_name`."
msgstr ""
"`config/ocs2/*.info` **不是** ROS 2 参数服务器。`robot_name` 选择 "
"`{robot_name}_description`；任务文件是 `{pkg}/config/ocs2/task.info`，除非 launch "
"YAML 设置了 `info_file_name`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:24
