"插件 "
"`basic_joint_controller/BasicJointController`。同时声明[框架共性键](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md"
"#framework-common-parameters)。Home 键：[共用 "
"Home](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#home-"
"statehome)。Hold 键：[共用 "
"Hold](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#hold-"
"statehold)。README [#120](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/controller/basic_joint_controller/README.md)"
" / [README_zh](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/e1b7a147effca2f29f7cced0b2942837b096c1ff/controller/basic_joint_controller/README_zh.md)。话题：[Basic"
" Joint Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md)。操作：[使用 Basic Joint "
"Controller](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)。"

